OL,3,AOpenAI scraps rollout of new model over
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI will not release its new AI
OL,7,Fmodel - GPT-6.1 Astra - due to safety
OL,8,Fconcerns, the ChatGPT-maker confirmed
OL,9,Fon Tuesday.
OL,11,FThe AI system - which performs tasks
OL,12,Flike browsing the web and using apps by
OL,13,Fitself - "didn't quite meet the bar" of
OL,14,Fthe company's standards, Saachi Jain,
OL,15,Fhead of safety systems at OpenAI, said.
OL,17,FOn Tuesday, OpenAI also issued an
OL,18,Fupdate on incidents - that occurred in
OL,19,FJune but were not made public until
OL,20,Flast week - in which its models
OL,21,Faccessed Australian government websites
OL,22,Fand systems without authorisation.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
